#org @DESC_PSYCHICTERRAIN
The user makes the\nground weird for\nfive turns, boosting\nPSYCHIC moves and\nblocking priority.

#org @DESC_GRASSPLEDGE
When combined with\nWATER Pledge, its\npower increases and\na vast swamp appears.

#org @DESC_FIREPLEDGE
When combined with\nGRASS Pledge, its\npower increases and a\nsea of fire appears.

#org @DESC_WATERPLEDGE
