#org @DESC_HOLDHANDS
The user and an\nally hold hands.\nThis makes them\nvery happy.

#org @DESC_DYNAMAX_CANNON
The user unleashes\na strong beam that\ndeals double damage\nto dynamaxed targets.

#org @DESC_SNIPE_SHOT
